Hi Avery,

Our 2026 Product Benchmarks report is out, built from anonymized data across 8,000 B2B products on Mixpanel.

A few numbers from it:
- Median week-1 retention for B2B SaaS: 41%. Top quartile: 63%.
- Accounts that hit a "core action" 3+ times in the first week renew at 2.1x the rate of those that don't
- The average B2B product ships a new feature to 100% of users within 9 days of the first rollout

The report includes benchmarks by company size and ACV, so you can compare against products like yours.

Download the report (free, no call required): https://mixpanel.com/l/benchmarks-2026?c=5wm2r

